        {
          "id": "problem",
          "type": "PROBLEM",
          "enabled": true,
          "narration": "Amaka is a makeup artist in Abuja. Chioma wants bridal makeup on Saturday at ten thirty. Forty-five thousand naira, with a fifteen thousand naira deposit. Amaka keeps the date for her. Tuesday, a reminder. Wednesday, another one. Thursday, abeg I forgot. Four days. Two reminders. One abeg I forgot. And a Saturday slot nobody else could take.",
          "estimatedDurationSeconds": 23.7,
          "visualInstructions": "timeline, labelled \"Amaka's week (illustration)\". Day 1 Monday \"now now\". Day 2 Tuesday reminder. Day 3 Wednesday reminder. Day 4 Thursday \"abeg I forgot\". Saturday 10:30 stays blocked the whole way across. The reminders are Amaka's own messages, not Iker's. [SFX: phone alarm repeating, cut on \"forgot\"] [GIF]",
